's going to learn, then you are dreaming! Prophetﷺ said:..كُلُّكُم راعٍ (Each one of you is a Shepherd, you will be asked upon your flock) It's your responsibility to teach your son. You will be asked. You have to have classes, in the home, at least one day a week, story about Companions, Teaching them their 'Aqeeda. Where is Allah? Allah is above his عرش (Throne) above. Teaching them these things Belief in the Prophetﷺ. What is the Shahada? What is Iman? Teaching them these things. Like that 7 years old, yes? I mentioned the story of the 7 year old They would have to be like a 7 year old but in an Islamic way, yes?", "Same thing Alhamdulillah, and there are people who do this. I have a friend's 7 year old daughter She wants to finish the Quran, memorises a lot of the Quran. She's one of the smartest kids اللهم بارك (May Allah Bless) So, we can do it but we need to put in the effort. So, homeschooling your children, if you can homeschool your children. It is more important than taking your children to; become Atheists and Agnostics and soldiers for the enemy -as they say- Literally, this is what you're taking them to do So either you take them to an Islamic school, because there are Islamic schools if you can not afford it you try to homeschool your kids, but there is no option in which you take your kids you leave them in a Kafir school you don't pay them attention, and you expect them to become Sheikh alIslam Ibn Taymiyyah", "It's not going to happen, Habibi. And don't come.. A Lot of people come to me, or they come to دُعاة, they come to Scholars, or they come to 'Ulama, or they come to Students of Knowledge saying: \"Look, my son left Islam\" No, No! You made your son leave Islam You didn't teach your son from when he was a baby, and at the end of the problem 16, 17, 18 years later, you want me to fix it! Do you know Cancer? Cancer can be treated in the early stages, there's many treatments for Cancer in the early stages But once cancer seeps through the rest of the body, you can not deal with it anymore.", "So you don't leave your child for 16, 18 years, has been absorbing these things, and then come later on when you have a problem.. \"Oh, fix the problem. Go!\" I'm going to give him a magic pill, and he's going to become Sheikh alislam! It's not going to happen brother TAKE CARE of your children. Raise your children upon correct beliefs and Foundations, seek knowledge, have good friends and Companions, and InshaAllah, Allahﷻ will give you guidance Look at the Companions of the Prophetﷺ, what they did, imitate it, and do likewise.",))
