k so? He remembers that. Oh, the prophet, oh, B, he was they tortured him and he was upon his religion. I don't care if this idiot is making fun of me. But he's not going to have that idea if you haven't taught him this idea when he was younger. if you haven't taught them this idea to begin with. So if you want your kids to practice your the knowledge of Islam, you have to build in them the love of the religion.", "Islam is not taken with for being forceful. Faith is never taken as being forceful. I'm talking to you about my experience and everybody here would know if kid would probably you're young. Your father is for forcing you to pray to just go to the masjid for the sake of going to the masjid. You just do the movements you know and you're not really praying. They have to have conviction. You have to explain to them why they're Muslims, why they believe what they believe. So like I said, so I don't spend an hour talking about this is a very important topic, but watch that video. It's very important.",))
