 at kindergarten they're already teaching them about rainbow things and issues from this age.", "Even kindergarten, let alone talking about first you know, elementary school or secondary school. Have to be very important where you put your kids. So take your kids to the mosque with you. As a father you go to the mosque and take your kid to the mosque. Take them to Islamic lectures so they can listen and they learn and from a young age so they can grow up with this in their mind. Rather than grow up in their mind watching Hollywood, grow up in their mind watching this, watching that, watching this YouTuber, watching that streamer. If they grow up watching that streamer, they would want to be a streamer.", "If they grow up in the mosque, they grow up watching Islamic lecture, they grow up with their role models as the Sahaba, they would want to be like the Sahabah. So, pay attention to this. It's very important. And when you deal with your kids, like I said, this harshness of everything and it it usually pushes your kid away. This is the fault that many parents do. You need to understand how to teach your kids the right way. You need to use motivation with them. Usually when kids are young, use motivational methods with them. Buy things that they love and desire.", "If you want them to do something, you want them to learn a story, you want them to come and sit and listen. When they do something good, Reward them. Buy gifts. By allowing them, for example, if they're going to watch watch something beneficial and they like watching maybe there is like these cartoons that teaches you some morals or something like that. They like watching them. So, make it as a gift. Make it as a motivational thing. If you if they do the right thing, they watch. You bring them gifts, you bring them sweets, you bring them stuff like that.", "Take them on trips as a motivational thing when they do something right. You have to put an effort as a parent to motivate your kids in the right way. The firmness can be applied and it has its own places, but firmness should only be applied when the matter is really serious. Talking about really serious issues, you do something really wrong and it needs to be corrected then firmness can be applied. Like you change your your tone of voice, you change your look when you look at them, you make sure that this is something serious. But if you're doing this all the time, then they wouldn't care.", "This should only be done when something is really serious so they can understand, \"Okay, I've done something really serious.\" Because I'm always good, kind, merciful to my kids, but all of a sudden now I'm being very firm, they understand this is something very serious. I need to make sure not to do this again.",))
